msgid "Subagent-Driven Development"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:15
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:17
msgid ""
"Execute implementation plans by dispatching fresh subagents per task with"
" systematic two-stage review."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:19
msgid ""
"**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + two-stage review (spec then"
" quality) = high quality, fast iteration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:21
msgid "When to Use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:23
msgid "Use this skill when:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:24
msgid ""
"You have an implementation plan (from writing-plans skill or user "
"requirements)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:25
msgid "Tasks are mostly independent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:26
msgid "Quality and spec compliance are important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:27
msgid "You want automated review between tasks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:29
msgid "**vs. manual execution:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:30
msgid "Fresh context per task (no confusion from accumulated state)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:31
msgid "Automated review process catches issues early"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:32
msgid "Consistent quality checks across all tasks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:33
msgid "Subagents can ask questions before starting work"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:35
msgid "The Process"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:37
msgid "1. Read and Parse Plan"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:39
msgid ""
"Read the plan file. Extract ALL tasks with their full text and context "
"upfront. Create a todo list:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:53
msgid ""
"**Key:** Read the plan ONCE. Extract everything. Don't make subagents "
"read the plan file — provide the full task text directly in context."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:55
msgid "2. Per-Task Workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:57
msgid "For EACH task in the plan:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:59
msgid "Step 1: Dispatch Implementer Subagent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:61
msgid "Use `delegate_task` with complete context:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:91
msgid "Step 2: Dispatch Spec Compliance Reviewer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:93
msgid "After the implementer completes, verify against the original spec:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:118
msgid ""
"**If spec issues found:** Fix gaps, then re-run spec review. Continue "
"only when spec-compliant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:120
msgid "Step 3: Dispatch Code Quality Reviewer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:122
msgid "After spec compliance passes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:150
msgid ""
"**If quality issues found:** Fix issues, re-review. Continue only when "
"approved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:152
msgid "Step 4: Mark Complete"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:158
msgid "3. Final Review"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:160
msgid "After ALL tasks are complete, dispatch a final integration reviewer:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:176
msgid "4. Verify and Commit"
msgstr ""

