#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:196
msgid "**Right size:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:197
msgid "\"Create User model with email and password fields\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:198
msgid "\"Add password hashing function\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:199
msgid "\"Create login endpoint\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:200
msgid "\"Add JWT token generation\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:201
msgid "\"Create registration endpoint\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:203
msgid "Red Flags — Never Do These"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:205
msgid "Start implementation without a plan"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:206
msgid "Skip reviews (spec compliance OR code quality)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:207
msgid "Proceed with unfixed critical/important issues"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:208
msgid ""
"Dispatch multiple implementation subagents for tasks that touch the same "
"files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:209
msgid "Make subagent read the plan file (provide full text in context instead)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:210
msgid ""
"Skip scene-setting context (subagent needs to understand where the task "
"fits)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:211
msgid "Ignore subagent questions (answer before letting them proceed)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:212
msgid "Accept \"close enough\" on spec compliance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:213
msgid ""
"Skip review loops (reviewer found issues → implementer fixes → review "
"again)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:214
msgid "Let implementer self-review replace actual review (both are needed)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:215
msgid "**Start code quality review before spec compliance is PASS** (wrong order)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:216
msgid "Move to next task while either review has open issues"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:218
msgid "Handling Issues"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:220
msgid "If Subagent Asks Questions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:222
msgid "Answer clearly and completely"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:223
msgid "Provide additional context if needed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:224
msgid "Don't rush them into implementation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:226
msgid "If Reviewer Finds Issues"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:228
msgid "Implementer subagent (or a new one) fixes them"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:229
msgid "Reviewer reviews again"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:230
msgid "Repeat until approved"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:231
msgid "Don't skip the re-review"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:233
msgid "If Subagent Fails a Task"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:235
msgid ""
"Dispatch a new fix subagent with specific instructions about what went "
"wrong"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:236
msgid "Don't try to fix manually in the controller session (context pollution)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:238
msgid "Efficiency Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:240
msgid "**Why fresh subagent per task:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:241
msgid "Prevents context pollution from accumulated state"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:242
msgid "Each subagent gets clean, focused context"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:243
msgid "No confusion from prior tasks' code or reasoning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:245
msgid "**Why two-stage review:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:246
msgid "Spec review catches under/over-building early"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:247
msgid "Quality review ensures the implementation is well-built"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:248
msgid "Catches issues before they compound across tasks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:250
msgid "**Cost trade-off:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:251
msgid "More subagent invocations (implementer + 2 reviewers per task)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/subagent-driven-development_SKILL.md:252
msgid ""
"But catches issues early (cheaper than debugging compounded problems "
"later)"
msgstr ""

